{"id":"delante","lemma":"delante","pos":"adv","rank":639,"glosses":["in front of, before (spatially)","forward, forwards (with hacia preceding it)","ahead (with por preceding it)"],"ipa":"/deˈlante/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-delante.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué ha pasado ahí delante?","en":"What's happened up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422351","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"past"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué puedes ver allí delante?","en":"What can you see up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300056","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"El autobús para delante de mi casa.","en":"The bus stops in front of my house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687426","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bus, coach"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"No me gusta actuar delante de otros.","en":"I don't like to perform in front of others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733662","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,null,{"g":"to act, to behave"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"¿Quién estaba sentado delante de usted en el cine?","en":"Who was that sitting in front of you at the movies?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693982","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"seated"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"cinema, moviehouse"}]}]}